# Canonical Turtle for the protocol-derived encoding of:
#   Jenna A. Bilbrey et al. (2025). Uncertainty quantification for neural network potential foundation models.
#   npj Computational Materials. doi:10.1038/s41524-025-01572-y
#
# Version read: publisher (sha256 0c6670bc0f05eb82...);
#   the DOI above is cited, numbers are those of the version read.
# Corpus rank 670 (Training/reliability). Method identity follows
#   artifacts/kg/METHODS.md (registry: artifacts/kg/methods-registry.csv).
# Generated by artifacts/scripts/encode_paper.py from artifacts/kg/encoding/specs/bilbrey2025.yaml.
#
# Encoding scope: MACE-MP-0 used as distributed, and MACE-MP-0 with a
# frozen interaction head and retrained readouts as a 7-member readout
# ensemble or a two-readout quantile model, on MPtrj and after transfer to
# HEA25 and H-ZSM-5 water data, with energy MAEs (Tables 1 and 3).
# Uncertainty, coverage and offset values are UQ metrics and are not
# encoded.

@prefix rdf: <http://www.w3.org/1999/02/22-rdf-syntax-ns#> .
@prefix rdfs: <http://www.w3.org/2000/01/rdf-schema#> .
